# Skips the CI coverage lanes take on purpose, one row per test:
# `package test reason`. Derived from the ubuntu-latest lanes of ci.yml: herdr is
# not on PATH; tmux and Node.js are, so no row skips for either. Environment skips
# appear here as the runner sees them. `.github/scripts/skip-ledger.sh check`
# fails the guards job on a skip the lanes take that no row lists, and on a row
# no lane takes.
